112,"source_quote":"兒去，頃之復來，攜食與之。","reading":"攜食者為童兒，受食者為仲德。","person_ids":["qsd_v11_ya1_AA","xjz_805_i1g"],"human_reviewed":false,"person_id":"xjz_805_i1g","kind":"received_sentence","note":"攜食者為童兒，受食者為仲德。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws","source_id":"s-songshu-046-wangyi-ws-ws2118581"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:l37s3-xjz_805_i1g","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p009","start_codepoint":25,"end_codepoint":60,"source_quote":"仲德三臨徐州，威德著於彭城，立佛寺作白狼、童子像於塔中，以河北所遇也。","reading":"三臨是任職次數；彭城建寺，白狼及童子像為先前遇險的回憶。","person_ids":["qsd_v11_ya1_AA","xjz_805_i1g"],"human_reviewed":false,"person_id":"xjz_805_i1g","kind":"received_sentence","note":"三臨是任職次數；彭城建寺，白狼及童子像為先前遇險的回憶。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws","source_id":"s-songshu-046-wangyi-ws-ws2118581"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:l37s6-xjz_805_i1g","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p009","start_codepoint":83,"end_codepoint":100,"source_quote":"亦於廟立白狼、童子壇，每祭必祠之。","reading":"廟祀白狼及童子，像與壇非新增人物。","person_ids":["xjz_805_i1g"],"human_reviewed":false,"person_id":"xjz_805_i1g","kind":"received_sentence","note":"廟祀白狼及童子，像與壇非新增人物。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws","source_id":"s-songshu-046-wangyi-ws-ws2118581"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi:p002:m0060","start":60,"end":64,"surface":"青衣童兒","kind":"person","person_id":"xjz_805_i1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整王懿後補傳單元上下文辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi:p002","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi:p002:m0078","start":78,"end":79,"surface":"兒","kind":"person","person_id":"xjz_805_i1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整王懿後補傳單元上下文辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi:p002","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"start":74,"end":78,"surface":"青衣童兒","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002:r0074","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002","person_id":"xjz_805_i1g","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"仲德少沈審，有意略，通陰陽，解聲律。苻氏之敗，仲德年十七，與兄叡同起義兵，與慕容垂戰，敗，仲德被重創走，與家屬相失。路經大澤，不能前，困臥林中。忽有青衣童兒騎牛行，見仲德，問曰：「食未？」仲德告飢。兒去，頃之復來，攜食與之。仲德食畢欲行，會水潦暴至，莫知所如。有一白狼至前，仰天而號，號訖銜仲德衣，因渡水，仲德隨之，獲濟，與叡相及。渡河至滑臺，復為翟遼所留，使為將帥。積年，仲德欲南歸，乃奔泰山，遼遣騎追之急，夜行，忽有炬火前導，仲德隨之，行百許里，乃免。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指童兒。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws","book_id":"b-songshu-046","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-046-wangyi-ws-ws2118581"},{"start":99,"end":100,"surface":"兒","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002:r0099","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002","person_id":"xjz_805_i1g","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"仲德少沈審，有意略，通陰陽，解聲律。苻氏之敗，仲德年十七，與兄叡同起義兵，與慕容垂戰，敗，仲德被重創走，與家屬相失。路經大澤，不能前，困臥林中。忽有青衣童兒騎牛行，見仲德，問曰：「食未？」仲德告飢。兒去，頃之復來，攜食與之。仲德食畢欲行，會水潦暴至，莫知所如。有一白狼至前，仰天而號，號訖銜仲德衣，因渡水，仲德隨之，獲濟，與叡相及。渡河至滑臺，復為翟遼所留，使為將帥。積年，仲德欲南歸，乃奔泰山，遼遣騎追之急，夜行，忽有炬火前導，仲德隨之，行百許里，乃免。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指童兒。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws","book_id":"b-songshu-046","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-046-wangyi-ws-ws2118581"},{"start":46,"end":48,"surface":"童子","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p009:r0046","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p009","person_id":"xjz_805_i1g","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"九年，又為鎮北將軍、徐州刺史。明年，加領兗州刺史。仲德三臨徐州，威德著於彭城，立佛寺作白狼、童子像於塔中，以河北所遇也。十三年，進號鎮北大將軍。十五年，卒，諡曰桓侯。亦於廟立白狼、童子壇，每祭必祠之。子正脩嗣，為家僮所殺。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指童兒。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws","book_id":"b-songshu-046","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-046-wangyi-ws-ws2118581"},{"start":90,"end":92,"surface":"童子","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p009:r0090","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p009","person_id":"xjz_805_i1g","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"九年，又為鎮北將軍、徐州刺史。明年，加領兗州刺史。仲德三臨徐州，威德著於彭城，立佛寺作白狼、童子像於塔中，以河北所遇也。十三年，進號鎮北大將軍。十五年，卒，諡曰桓侯。亦於廟立白狼、童子壇，每祭必祠之。子正脩嗣，為家僮所殺。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指童兒。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws","book_id":"b-songshu-046","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-046-wangyi-ws-ws2118581"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002","text":"仲德少沈審，有意略，通陰陽，解聲律。苻氏之敗，仲德年十七，與兄叡同起義兵，與慕容垂戰，敗，仲德被重創走，與家屬相失。路經大澤，不能前，困臥林中。忽有青衣童兒騎牛行，見仲德，問曰：「食未？」仲德告飢。兒去，頃之復來，攜食與之。仲德食畢欲行，會水潦暴至，莫知所如。有一白狼至前，仰天而號，號訖銜仲德衣，因渡水，仲德隨之，獲濟，與叡相及。渡河至滑臺，復為翟遼所留，使為將帥。積年，仲德欲南歸，乃奔泰山，遼遣騎追之急，夜行，忽有炬火前導，仲德隨之，行百許里，乃免。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":2,"surface":"仲德","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002:m0000","person_id":"qsd_v11_ya1_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作仲德。"},{"start":23,"end":25,"surface":"仲德","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002:m0023","person_id":"qsd_v11_ya1_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作仲德。"},{"start":31,"end":32,"surface":"叡","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002:m0031","person_id":"lrq_cdc_wxj","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作叡。"},{"start":38,"end":41,"surface":"慕容垂","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002:m0038","person_id":"t7y_8p2_aeb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作慕容垂。"},{"start":45,"end":47,"surface":"仲德","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002:m0045","person_id":"qsd_v11_ya1_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作仲德。"},{"start":53,"end":55,"surface":"家屬","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002:u0053","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"傳中家屬無名，成員未詳。"},{"start":83,"end":85,"surface":"仲德","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p002:m0083","person_id":"qsd_v11_ya1_AA","kind":"person","status