段敘事與具名角色讀作正脩。"},{"start":106,"end":108,"surface":"家僮","id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws:p009:u0106","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"殺王正脩的家僮，無姓名。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":37,"last_line":37,"revision_id":2118581,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":2480,"raw_end":2591,"raw_character_offsets":[2480,2481,2482,2483,2484,2485,2486,2487,2488,2489,2490,2491,2492,2493,2494,2495,2496,2497,2498,2499,2500,2501,2502,2503,2504,2505,2506,2507,2508,2509,2510,2511,2512,2513,2514,2515,2516,2517,2518,2519,2520,2521,2522,2523,2524,2525,2526,2527,2528,2529,2530,2531,2532,2533,2534,2535,2536,2537,2538,2539,2540,2541,2542,2543,2544,2545,2546,2547,2548,2549,2550,2551,2552,2553,2554,2555,2556,2557,2558,2559,2560,2561,2562,2563,2564,2565,2566,2567,2568,2569,2570,2571,2572,2573,2574,2575,2576,2577,2578,2579,2580,2581,2582,2583,2584,2585,2586,2587,2588,2589,2590],"projection_sha256":"183c68fa424b97c89803c1d45fde3ea15309475754cb4731d423c8fe1cb21f39"},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi-ws","book_id":"b-songshu-046","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-046-wangyi-ws-ws2118581"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi:p002","text":"仲德少沈審有意畧通隂陽解聲律苻氏之敗仲德年十七與兄叡同起義兵與慕容垂戰敗仲德被重創走與家屬相失路經大澤不能前困卧林中忽有青衣童兒騎牛行見仲德問曰食未仲德告飢兒去頃之復來携食與之仲德食畢欲行會水潦暴至莫知所如有一白狼至前仰天而號號訖銜仲德衣因渡水仲德隨之獲濟與叡相及渡河至滑臺復為翟遼所留使為將帥積年仲德欲南歸乃奔太山遼遣騎追之急夜行忽有炬火前導仲德隨之行百許里乃免","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"仲德","kind":"person","person_id":"qsd_v11_ya1_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整王懿後補傳單元上下文辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi:p002:m0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"仲德","kind":"person","person_id":"qsd_v11_ya1_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整王懿後補傳單元上下文辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-wangyi:p002:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"叡","kind":"person","person_id":"lrq_cdc_wxj","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"完整王懿後補傳單元上下文辨識；AI判讀，未圖校。"},{"id":"c-songshu-